    category: "treaty",
    jurisdiction: "international",
    ipType: "design",
    content: `Hague Agreement — international industrial design registration. India joined 2019. FOR AYURVEDIC PRODUCTS: (1) Single application with WIPO → Protection in 90+ designated countries; (2) Up to 100 designs per application (same Locarno class); (3) Relevant for: packaging, containers, medical devices, product shapes, labels; (4) DURATION: 5 years, renewable to 15 years (varies by country); (5) FEES: Relatively modest — base fee + per-design + per-designation; (6) STRATEGY: File Indian design first → Hague for export markets within 6 months (priority). Focus on distinctive, non-functional visual features of packaging.`,
